     5	Audit for the first-order source correction selected by the full mouth profile.
     6	
     7	The paper-claimed moment-shift identities are
     8	    delta_g = - Cov_*(c, R),   delta_S = - Cov_*(K_q, R),
     9	where delta_Sigma = -Sigma_* (R - <R>_*) is the linearized correction to the
    10	canonical exponential source.  The SymPy script verifies these by:
    11	
    12	  (1) symbolically defining delta_Sigma = -Sigma_*(R - <R>_*) (hand form), and
    13	  (2) numerically integrating delta_g_int = int c(x) delta_Sigma dx and
    14	      checking it matches the abstract covariance form to high precision.
    15	
    16	Numeric Pi_star, r1, r2 anchors (Pi_star = canonical Family-1 value from notes;
    17	r1, r2 are arbitrary non-zero example residual coefficients) make the integral
